{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man trapped by crushing debt inside an underwater habitat, where survival means obedience.  <br>What looked like an opportunity for freedom turns out to be a prison of routine, isolation, and impossible choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abyss Depth: Control</strong> is a <strong>point-and-click horror </strong> set 2000 meters beneath the ocean:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point and click to survive</strong> \u2013 Operate consoles, levers, and terminals in a claustrophobic station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depression and control</strong> \u2013 Each task feels simple, but failure has immediate consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect the diver</strong> \u2013 A lone diver depends on your light to keep them alive outside the station. Fail, and they never come back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter</strong> \u2013 Who survives, and what the abyss takes from you, depends on your actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, you\u2019re not an adventurer\u2014you\u2019re a worker. And your only reward for survival is another shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings new orders. Every mistake has a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in the deep, the only thing more dangerous than the unknown is failing the people who still depend on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pull The Lever</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053130/extras/0abec4aba545367a5585eb09d78bf53a.poster.avif?t=1773092682\" width=426 hei